{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": { "columns": 12, "gap": 16 },
    "children": [

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "APIs & external interfaces", "variant": "hero" },
        "data": { "dataset": "summary" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "KPIStrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                { "label": "Open URL",        "field": "open_url_steps",       "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "step_name": "Open URL" } } } },
                { "label": "Insert from URL", "field": "insert_url_steps",     "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "step_name": "Insert from URL" } } } },
                { "label": "Import Records",  "field": "import_records_steps", "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "step_name": "Import Records" } } } },
                { "label": "MBS / Plugin",    "field": "mbs_plugin_hits",      "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "ref_type": "Plugin" } } } },
                { "label": "Web Viewer",      "field": "web_viewer_hits",      "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "context": "Web Viewer" } } } },
                { "label": "Calculations",    "field": "calc_step_hits",       "format": "number",
                  "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                               "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                         "params": { "source_type": "Script (Calc Step)" } } } },
                { "label": "Distinct URLs",   "field": "distinct_urls",        "format": "number" },
                { "label": "External sources","field": "external_sources",     "format": "number" }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "API families" },
        "data": { "dataset": "api_families" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "api_family",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "columns": [
                { "field": "api_family",      "label": "Family" },
                { "field": "hits",            "label": "Hits",            "align": "right" },
                { "field": "hosts",           "label": "Hosts",           "align": "right" },
                { "field": "urls",            "label": "URLs",            "align": "right" },
                { "field": "files",           "label": "Files",           "align": "right" },
                { "field": "script_step",     "label": "Script Step",     "align": "right", "format": "count" },
                { "field": "plugin",          "label": "Plugin",          "align": "right", "format": "count" },
                { "field": "layout_object",   "label": "Layout Object",   "align": "right", "format": "count" },
                { "field": "field",           "label": "Field",           "align": "right", "format": "count" },
                { "field": "custom_function", "label": "Custom Function", "align": "right", "format": "count" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                              "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                        "params": { "api_family": "{{api_family}}" } } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "URL details" },
        "data": { "dataset": "url_details" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "url",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "columns": [
                { "field": "api_family",  "label": "Family",       "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "ref_type",    "label": "Ref type",     "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "host",        "label": "Host" },
                { "field": "name",        "label": "Script/Context" },
                { "field": "file",        "label": "File" },
                { "field": "context",     "label": "Step/Type" },
                { "field": "step_index",  "label": "#",            "align": "right" },
                { "field": "url",         "label": "URL" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": { "action": "openObject",
                              "args": { "uuid": "{{target_uuid}}",
                                        "type": "{{target_type}}",
                                        "file": "{{file}}",
                                        "params": { "step":  "{{step_uuid}}",
                                                    "types": "{{layout_filter_types}}" } } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "External data sources (FileMaker / ODBC)" },
        "data": { "dataset": "external_sources" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "name",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "columns": [
                { "field": "name",            "label": "Target" },
                { "field": "type",            "label": "Type",         "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "used_in_files",   "label": "Files",        "align": "right" },
                { "field": "to_count",        "label": "TOs",          "align": "right" },
                { "field": "sample_to_name",  "label": "Sample TO" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": { "action": "openObject",
                              "args": { "uuid": "{{sample_to_uuid}}",
                                        "type": "TableOccurrence" } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "content": "## Notes\n\nThis dashboard is a **generic template** intended for reuse in other FileMaker projects. The API-family classification covers typical cloud / SaaS / communication / AI providers. For project-specific families adjust the `CASE WHEN url ILIKE …` blocks in `data/url_details.sql` and `data/api_families.sql` together (see the header comment in `url_details.sql`).\n\n- **KPIs as filters** (across every API family): *Open URL*, *Insert from URL* count script steps of that type with a URL in the step text. *Import Records* counts **every** Import-Records step regardless of source (file / URL / variable) — as an interface indicator. *MBS / Plugin* counts URLs in calculations using MBS / CURL / Files calls. *Web Viewer* counts Web Viewer sources from layouts. *Calculations* counts script-step formulas (Set Variable, Set Field, If …). *Distinct URLs* and *External sources* are pure statistics tiles without filtering.\n- **API-families table**: clicking a family row filters the detail list. Clicking *All* clears the filter. The *Script Step*, *Plugin*, *Layout Object*, *Field*, *Custom Function* columns show how a family's URLs are distributed across reference types; zero values are hidden.\n- **Ref type**: `Plugin` overrides the container type when the calculation text calls MBS or plugin functions (`CURL.*`, `MBS(…)`, `Files.*`, `Plugin.*`).\n- **Sources**: `Script (URL Step)` = `Open URL` / `Insert from URL`. `Script (Import)` = every `Import Records`. `Script (Calc Step)` = steps with a URL in the formula expression. `Custom Function` = URL in the CF body. `Field` = Calculated or AutoEnter formula. `Layout Object` = Hide / Tooltip / Label / Trigger param or Web Viewer source.\n- **Secret masking**: query parameters `api_key`, `token`, `password`, `secret`, `auth`, `signature` are reduced to `[masked]` in the URL column.\n- **Navigation**: clicking a detail row opens the matching object (Script + step anchor, Custom Function, Field, Layout — for Web Viewer with the additional layout filter `Container,Web Viewer`). Clicking an external data source opens the alphabetically first TableOccurrence for that source.\n- **Sorting**: column headings in API families, URL details and External data sources are clickable (▲▼)."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
